# Editor/backup droppings the prod host leaves beside the live config. The DR
# restore rsync'd them into data/ and one was committed in e4bae60f carrying a
# live S3 access key id and secret -- to a public repo, which is why AWS has
# deleted every key rotated into AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID since. The sync and restore
# both exclude them now; this is the backstop for a hand-copied tree.
*~
*.bak
*.bak.*
*.swp
node_modules
.DS_Store
infra/ansible/roles/luarocks/.DS_Store
infra/.DS_Store
html/.DS_Store
.qodo

# Dashboard build artifacts
dashboard/bin/

# Local POP migration dumps (do not commit live host data)
Source POP/
Target POP/
Migration-to-copy/
bin/
